<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Food Lion said upped.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Food Lion said upped.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney upgraded Food Lion Inc Class B shares to buy from outperform, according to a market source.</p>
<p>-- Class B shares rose 5/8 to 9.</p>
</text>
